rë␀␀␀)r␀␀␀r}␀␀␀r␀␀␀Ú_Tc␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ón␀␀␀—␀e␀Zd␀ZdZeddœdedej␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ej␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀e	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀de
